+    // ── Wave 54 (lane L4, CBB-android): the WPT content-box band rule ─────
+    // (Re-landed in wave 55, lane L2 unit U1, after the wave-54 probe's
+    // revert 8deddc19; tools/titan/results/wave55-cbb-android/_note.md.)
